* Virginia Beach Library Policy on Commercial Donations


=================
library-netnews-analogy
=================
* The Library/Netnews analogy (C. M. Kadie)

An article from CAF-News 1.30. Carl Kadie tries to clarify the analogy
between a traditional library and a computer. The note says that
Netnews should compared to a library, rather it should be compared to
the set of publications from which a library selects. The note also
includes the Hypothetical Netnews Bill of Rights, a modification of
the ALA's Library Bill of Rights.

